From: jason-liu-4980 <38558962+jason-liu-4980@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 21:30:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] soc: sprd: support Orca clocks, DVFS and SY108 sensors

Add Orca clocks, firmware-mediated CPU frequency scaling, PM_SYS DDR votes through SIPC, thermal aggregation and the SY108 MCU ADC driver. Retain firmware arbitration of DDR frequency and expose board sensor readings through the standard kernel interfaces.
